<title>HONG KONG: Cheung Kong ups Hutchison stake.</title>
<headline>Cheung Kong ups Hutchison stake.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cheung Kong (Holdings) Ltd's stake in fellow conglomerate Hutchison Whampoa Ltd has risen to 49.61 percent, up from 48.95 percent previously, the Stock Exchange of Hong Kong said on Friday.</p>
<p>The stock exchange said Cheung Kong made the purchases at an average HK$57.250 per share during March 27 to April 1.</p>
<p>It said Cheung Kong now held 1.921 billion Hutchison shares, up from 1.895 billion Hutchison shares.</p>
<p>Hutchison shares stood at HK$55.25 at midday Friday, up HK$1.25.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
